SUMMARY:Greater Houston Business Procurement Breakfast
DESCRIPTION:Join the B2G Victory Team and come by their table at the Greater Houston Business Procurement Forum (GHBP). \nBreakfast Served: 8:00AM- 9:00AM \nThe GHBP is excited to: \n\nProvide a venue that “Makes Business Happen” for Houston’s small and minority business community and the community at large.\nConnects key contacts that lead to contracts and financing\nFacilitate  management and technical assistance\nAssist in the growth and development of the Houston Community\nGenerates real business Success Stories\n\nFor more information about the Greater Houston Business Procurement (GHBP) Forum\, visit: https://ghbpf.org/contact/#calendar-fe92efaa-617b-4a09-bd7f-7e198bdab716-event-m681n7cz
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/greater-houston-business-procurement-breakfast-10/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Academic Network,Corporate Innovators,Founders & Startups,General Community,Investors & Capital,Mentorship,Networking,Start Here
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/321A8335.jpg?ver=1765822093
END:VEVENT
